==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Incubator]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

